  "body": "Stacked on #1139 (on #1123, #560, #551). Fork synced at v0.18.0.\n\n## What changed\n- Machine editor (`machine_edm.rs`): for a `wire_edm` machine, a Wire section in place of Spindle/Tooling/Coolants - wire keys (guide planes, max taper, AWT, wire diameters), `edm.codes` rows (condition, comp_off, thread, cut, tip_disposal + any other name present) and the condition table (id, name, gap, wire diameter, role); every absent value reads \"not stated\". Edits go through the existing `EditMachineApply` (-> LoadMachine / SetSetupMachine), one undo step; no new command, so no new MCP tool.\n- Door: `machine::edm_refusal` (chained into `tooling_refusal`) refuses by name a `condition` code with no `{id}`, a blank/bracketed code, a condition with no id, a duplicate id.\n- Wire Contour page: no Tool row (it silently adopted the rack's first tool into the draft) and no Coolant row. Ribbon: the cell is no longer held by an empty rack; quick-add names the machine's first condition. The op page stays additive for #1109 (kerf side, edge clearance) and #534.\n- Machine editor fields now scroll, Apply/Revert stay in reach.\n- Decisions: `docs/decisions/535-wire-ui.md`.\n\n## Tested\n- `machine_wire_edm::the_machine_editor_states_the_wire_section_refuses_by_name_and_undoes_in_one_step` (real shell events: add condition, type id, code without {id} refused by name, with {id} applied, one undo).\n- `machine_wire_edm::a_wire_contour_quick_adds_with_the_first_condition_and_its_page_has_no_tool_row` (side edit via the combo + Apply, one undo).\n- `structural::wire_machine_editor_structure`, `holders::tests::edm_refusal_names_the_code_or_condition_that_cannot_be_meant`; `every_registry_kind_gets_its_tab_bar` and `tips_match_the_imgui_table` updated for tool-less kinds.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/issue/533-wire-iso-post` green on the final tree; clippy -D warnings on app/ui clean.\n\n## Not exercised\nPicking the start hole in the viewport (still typed); a real wire control; PNG snapshots (never changed); sinker keys.\n\nChangelog: Wire EDM machine editor section (keys, codes, conditions) and a tool-less Wire Contour page (#535)\nEffort: medium (no escalation)\n\nFixes #535\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
